        <mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#555A65&quot;&gt;One runner's update as the pure state machine in &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;pitcrew-core&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;UpdatePhase&lt;/span&gt;). The service feeds events in and carries out the commands returned; a running job is never killed, and an update cannot be cancelled after the swap (ADR 0002).&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#17181C;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="82" width="1400" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
