        <mxCell id="c42" value="Postponed and Cancelled leave the installed version untouched. Failed with “needs attention” (no previous binary, or the roll-back itself failed) leaves the runner stopped and tells the user. Timeouts are the &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;UpdateTimeouts&lt;/span&gt; defaults: drain 3 h, stop 2 min, confirm 5 min." style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#17181C;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555A65;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="900" width="900" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
